// 1. each step compute $\mathrm{agreement}_t = \mathrm{mean}(\hat{y}_t = \hat{y}_{t-1})$
// 2. $\mathrm{EMA}_t = \alpha\,\mathrm{agreement}_t + (1-\alpha)\,\mathrm{EMA}_{t-1}$ with $\alpha=0.3$
// 3. after warm-up: if EMA $>$ relax-thr, $I \leftarrow \min(I+1, I_{\max})$
// 4. if EMA $<$ tighten-thr ($0.50$), $I \leftarrow \max(I-1, I_{\text{start}})$
// 5. transfer_ratio interpolated in $[0.15, 0.30]$ by EMA
// 6. on new block: reset interval to $I_{\text{start}}$, damp EMA by $0.5$
// 7. always: row_selector = lowest_value_feature_similarity, kv_update = scatter_refresh

// 1. base by total_steps: short ($\leq 64$) -> $I_{\text{base}}=2,\,I_{\max}=3$; long -> $I_{\text{base}}=8,\,I_{\max}=16$
// 2. avg_sim, min_sim, max_diff over local masked positions
// 3. if avg_sim $\geq 0.98$ and min_sim $\geq 0.85$: $I \leftarrow \min(1.8\,I_{\text{base}}, I_{\max})$, transfer $=$ min_transfer
// 4. elif avg_sim $\geq 0.92$ and min_sim $\geq 0.70$: $I \leftarrow 1.4\,I_{\text{base}}$, transfer $=1.5\,$min_transfer
// 5. elif avg_sim $<0.75$ or min_sim $<0.30$: $I \leftarrow I_{\text{base}}/2$, transfer $=0.40$
// 6. if max_diff $>0.85$: $I \leftarrow I-1$
// 7. token_transfer: low-confidence with threshold $=0.99$ (commit ultra-confident)

// 1. base $(P,G,T)$ = math (44,5,0.24) / humaneval (52,8,0.18) / lm_eval (24,1,0.0)
// 2. progress $= step/\text{total}$, $u = 0.7\,\overline{\text{difficulty}} + 0.3\,(1-\overline{\text{similarity}})$
// 3. if workload = lm_eval -> use_cache = True but $G=1$, $T=0$ (effectively no skip)
// 4. math: if progress $<0.30$ or $u>0.52$: $G=4,T=0.28$; elif $u>0.38$: $G=5,T=0.24$; else $G=6,T=0.20$
// 5. humaneval: if progress $<0.18$ or $u>0.56$: $G=6,T=0.22$; elif $u>0.35$: $G=8,T=0.18$; else $G=10$ (or $9$), $T=0.14$
// 6. token_transfer: extra +1 transfer in early math/humaneval steps when remaining tokens > threshold

// 1. presets: math (P=40,G=4,T=0.30); humaneval (P=40,G=5,T=0.30); lm_eval -> use_cache=False
// 2. progress $= step/(\text{total}-1)$
// 3. if progress $<0.3$: $G=G_b,\ T=T_b$
// 4. elif progress $<0.7$: $G=2G_b,\ T=1.2\,T_b$
// 5. else: $G=3G_b,\ T=\min(0.5,1.5T_b)$
// 6. let stable_frac = EMA over (max-prob mean $>0.7$ AND var $<0.01$)
// 7. if stable_frac $>0.6$: $G \leftarrow \max(G,\, \lfloor G_b(1+\text{stable\_frac})\rfloor),\ T\leftarrow T+0.1\,\text{stable\_frac}$
// 8. cap $G \leq$ math:$12$ / humaneval:$15$

// 1. EMA(alpha=0.3) on (difficulty, similarity, importance) over masked tokens
// 2. error $e = \bar{d} - 0.5$, gain $K_p=0.5$
// 3. factor $= 1/(1+K_p e)$ if $e>0$ else $1+K_p|e|$
// 4. $G \leftarrow \max(1, \lfloor G_{\text{base}}\,\text{factor}\rfloor)$
// 5. $T \leftarrow \min\!\bigl(0.5,\, T_{\text{base}}/\max(0.1, \bar{s})\bigr)$
// 6. $P \leftarrow \max(1, \lfloor P_{\text{base}}(1+\bar{i})\rfloor)$
